<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Technical glitch delays Czech bourse results.</title>
<headline>Technical glitch delays Czech bourse results.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the morning fixing on the Prague Stock Exchange, which are usually released at 1000 GMT, have been delayed due to technical problems.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
